#, no-wrap
msgid "frexp"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:11
msgid ""
"frexp, frexpf, frexpl - convert floating-point number to fractional and "
"integral components"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<double frexp(double >I<x>B<, int *>I<e>B<);>\n"
"B<float frexpf(float >I<x>B<, int *>I<e>B<);>\n"
"B<long double frexpl(long double >I<x>B<, int *>I<e>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:30
msgid "B<frexpf>(), B<frexpl>():"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:41
msgid ""
"These functions are used to split the number I<x> into a normalized fraction "
"and an exponent which is stored in I<e>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:51
msgid ""
"These functions return the normalized fraction.  If the argument I<x> is not "
"zero, the normalized fraction is I<x> times a power of two, and its absolute "
"value is always in the range 1/2 (inclusive) to 1 (exclusive), that is, "
"[0.5,1)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:57
msgid ""
"If I<x> is zero, then the normalized fraction is zero and zero is stored in "
"I<e>."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:64
msgid "If I<x> is a NaN, a NaN is returned, and the value of I<*e> is unspecified."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/frexp.3:71
msgid ""
"If I<x> is positive infinity (negative infinity), positive infinity "
"(negative infinity) is returned, and the value of I<*e> is unspecified."
msgstr ""

