"It is typically used for rounding up a pointer to align it or increasing a "
"buffer to be allocated."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/roundup.3:33
msgid ""
"This API is not designed to be generic, and doesn't work in some cases that "
"are not important for the typical use cases described above.  See CAVEATS."
