"If I<x> is an infinity, and I<e> is negative infinity, a domain error "
"occurs, and a NaN is returned."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/scalb.3:122 build/C/man3/scalbln.3:102
msgid ""
"If the result underflows, a range error occurs, and the functions return "
"zero, with a sign the same as I<x>."
msgstr ""

#. type: TP
#: build/C/man3/scalb.3:129
#, no-wrap
