#: build/C/man3/tgamma.3:106
msgid ""
"If I<x> is -0 or +0, a pole error occurs, and the functions return "
"B<HUGE_VAL>, B<HUGE_VALF>, or B<HUGE_VALL>, respectively, with the same sign "
"as the 0."
