#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/tgamma.3:191
msgid ""
"Before glibc 2.18, the glibc implementation of these functions did not set "
"I<errno> to B<EDOM> when I<x> is negative infinity."
msgstr ""

#.  https://www.sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=6810
